WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.860
This is the part that matters most.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.200
Use Vegans Explore in your day to day, and tell us what is working,

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.780
what is not, and what you wish you could do.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:14.160
The Feedback button is on every page, and it starts with the page you are

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:14.440
on.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.140
Ask your Guide anything, and if your Guide does not know,

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.200
members can ask a person on our team, free.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.900
Search for something we do not have yet, and it goes straight into our team's

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:26.260
queue.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.440
Know a place, a person or a group we should list?

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.180
Tell us, and we check it.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.060
Every city's board has Suggest a Topic for the Daily Pulse.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.940
Know someone in your community who should be spotlighted?

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:38.960
Nominate them.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:42.500
We are real people, supported by technology,

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.320
and we build from what you send every day.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:46.860
We want to hear from you.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.440
As a member, you shape what we fix and what we build next,

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.780
so let us know if something needs to be fixed.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.820
Membership is free.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:00.080
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.700
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:04.799
Bring people with you:

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:09.220
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:12.680
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:17.380
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.000
community.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.120
Tell us one thing today.

